        "note_request_suggestions": [
          {
            "suggestion": "This post requires additional context and is misleading. Elon Musk states that Grok 4.6 is out, but this is largely not the case. Grok 4.6 is not presently available on Grok.com or the Grok App. It appears that Grok 4.6 may be available to some Apple users that are making use of very specific features like Grok Build, but a blanket statement of \"Grok 4.6 is out\" suggests the entire model is available, which is not the case. It suggests it is available to all users, which is not the case. It suggests it is available to \"early use\" users like those that are supporters on Grok.com,  which is not the case. Grok 4.6 may be available to a small number of users for very specific features like Grok Build, but as of the present moment it is not available to users on Grok.com, X, X Android Users, and Grok Android users. Unsure who precisely it IS available to, but \"out now\" is misleading at the least. Suggest collaborative AI/Grok statement to include additional context. Presently, Grok.com SuperGrok Heavy users do not have access, and if anyone would have early access it would be those users. ",
